    {
     "title": "Out of the Past: Paper Tiger’s James Gray on the potent, personal authenticity of his pressurized crime saga",
     "link": "https://letterboxd.com/journal/james-gray-paper-tiger-interview/",
     "time": "2026-11-14T04:55:49+13:00",
     "img": "https://a.ltrbxd.com/resized/sm/upload/kd/9f/rr/19/tiger-0-960-0-540-crop-fill.jpg?k=e02026454d",
     "intro": "As Paper Tiger arrives in theaters, writer-director James Gray sits down with Isaac Feldberg to discuss the tactile sights and transportive sounds of his devastatingly personal New York crime drama.",
     "category": "Interview"
